-- MO HINH CHI SO POKEMON + NGAN SACH TRANG BI (docs/thiet-ke-game.md).
-- SINH BOI tools/pokemon/SinhSqlChiSo.java tu com.htbb.pokemon.ChiSoTrangBi + NganSachTrangBi - KHONG SUA TAY.
-- IDEMPOTENT: chay lai bao nhieu lan cung ra cung ket qua. Chi THEM/DOI nghia, khong xoa dong nao.
-- Phan 1: data_attribute - ten nguoi choi doc, don vi (ispercent), mau, mo ta; xoa namein (tieng Indonesia).
--          GIU NGUYEN ID va so dong (client tra ten theo vi tri dong, test/KiemBangThuocTinh).
-- Phan 2: data_item - KEP (LEAST, chi giam, khong bao gio tang) chi so atb0..6 cua trang bi nhan vat
--          (type 0..12, 19; khong dong thoi trang atb9<>0, khong khung che tao moi atb<=1) ve tran mon
--          o +0 = chuan bac x 1,30 + 2 (NganSachTrangBi.tranMon). Theo QUY TAC (type, level) nen an toan
--          khi chay lai tren dump da chay. Do cua nguoi choi (tob_char) KHONG doi: server kep luc tinh
--          (real.ChiSoTrangBiGame.atb, chi khi sv.lau_dai=1).

-- ===== Phan 1: data_attribute =====
